The Docker IMAGE produced by this recipe is built FROM the NVIDIA base container
`ghcr.io/nvidia-ai-iot/vllm:latest-jetson-thor` and bundles:
  - vLLM (Apache-2.0)
  - PyTorch (BSD-3-Clause)
  - NVIDIA CUDA runtime + driver components (NVIDIA Deep Learning Container / CUDA EULA)

